-- WITHIN d OF THE JOIN names the instant the ENCLOSING obligation's join
-- fired (EVERY-EACH-QUANTIFIER-SPEC §5.1.1, R-Q7B). A rule that is not inside
-- any HENCE or LEST has no enclosing obligation, so there is no join to name.
-- THE DEADLINE is refused for the same reason; the anchor OF THE ARMING is
-- not, because in a top-level obligation's own WITHIN it is that
-- obligation's own arming — the default. (THE ARMING as a value written
-- outside an obligation's own lines is refused: refusal 8,
-- lifecycle-arming-outside-obligation.l4.)

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Buyer
    Seller

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Pay
    Deliver

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
bad MEANS PARTY Buyer MUST Pay WITHIN 5 OF THE JOIN

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`also bad` MEANS PARTY Buyer MUST Pay WITHIN 5 OF THE DEADLINE

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
fine MEANS PARTY Buyer MUST Pay WITHIN 5 OF THE ARMING
